stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CONFORMING: Token issued<br/>consistent with BPoS design
    CONFORMING --> DEVIATION_DETECTED: Comparison engine detects deviation
    DEVIATION_DETECTED --> UNDER_REVIEW: Relevant viewpoints notified
    UNDER_REVIEW --> CONFORMING: Deviation resolved
    UNDER_REVIEW --> DESIGN_AMENDED: Judged a gap in the design<br/>BPoS and contract version updated
    UNDER_REVIEW --> RESTRICTED: FEK circuit breaker triggered<br/>transfers restricted
    DESIGN_AMENDED --> CONFORMING
    RESTRICTED --> UNDER_REVIEW
    CONFORMING --> [*]: Maturity or full redemption

    note right of DESIGN_AMENDED
        A deviation is not necessarily an error
        It may indicate the design did not
        cover the case, in which case
        BPoS should be corrected
    end note
